    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Candidate dataset: Cook, Universality in Elementary Cellular Automata";
    dc:description "published checkable proof of rule 110 universality";
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.25088/ComplexSystems.15.1.1>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch11-14--gpt--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
